<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <title>INSERT_OWNER packages (apt + dnf)</title>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>INSERT_OWNER Linux packages</h1>
  <p>Hosted on GitHub Pages for apt and dnf.</p>
  <h2>apt</h2>
  <pre>curl -fsSL @REPO_URL@/install-apt.sh | sudo bash
sudo apt-get install -y INSERT_REPO</pre>
  <h2>dnf</h2>
  <pre>curl -fsSL @REPO_URL@/install-dnf.sh | sudo bash
sudo dnf install -y INSERT_REPO</pre>
  <p>Repo root: <a href="@REPO_URL@">@REPO_URL@</a></p>
</body>
</html>
